{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30012_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3fc4182b6af0efee73fec2287564c9c4a4a41e76e40f6ebd4c8c638872ccc352",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5199287a15bc54e1fb808671827bd3b2561b825bec0d41a591daa9b1526dd88",
      "text": "……我是这么想的。所以，\n由这样的我来回答那封咨询的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6d783780b14cd81598df7372d923af1da44c58ff16cf4d8866e5075b694bb56",
      "text": "我说啊，直央确实是个胆小鬼没错，\n但这有什么不好的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f22ae5d55a510f57d21d03d043941085cf771fd4f5e1be8c4d98bcc5ae412a2",
      "text": "是这样哦。而且直央君身上，\n不是有很多非常棒的闪光点吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:782c9b6a39e5e81e3dc28e9cdfae23be63fb6719b624e66ed53afe81cf9198c8",
      "text": "平时总是那么认真，对待工作全力以赴……\n前阵子将棋的咨询也是一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bb17f70a6f420cbaabbd484b3dcfa3b06dcf85b481f8aae2adc1eabac5177ca",
      "text": "你特意来向我征求意见，\n问“我可以自己准备棋谱吗”，对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a510206cd465bae30da03a648addcffc6da1c99180f457aa4651848bb31ef0d",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー……\n还有，志狼君也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f90f7f0dc21fe842f50d8f535e57d797aacc8f9c90e2a930f8ec9eab6361d8b",
      "text": "花音也觉得哦，直央君虽然有点胆小，\n但花音最喜欢温柔的直央君了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d1f20405345c83d9e6334f1df88883ee9b4177a5c7d1274bfafeacfcd29c56b",
      "text": "对花音的玩偶也很温柔……\n所以花音觉得，完全不用那么在意啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30012_01:1_3_30012_01_i:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
